# Build artefacts.
/bin/
/dist/

# The built binary, anchored to the repository root.
#
# This must stay anchored. A bare `cli-zapp` pattern matches any file or
# directory of that name at any depth — including `cmd/cli-zapp/` — which is
# how the program's entry point went untracked and the committed tree stopped
# building. A gitignore pattern that is meant for one artefact must say where
# it is.
#/cli-zapp

# Test and coverage output.
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.test
*.prof

# Vendor directory is committed deliberately for reproducible builds; see
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md. It is not ignored.

# Local configuration and secrets. The linked session lives in the system
# keyring, but a stray config must never be committed.
/cli-zapp.toml
/.env
*.key

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/